# This archive is the ONLY copy of the historical run data — the git snapshot taken
# before the overhaul does not contain it (runs/ is ignored inside each engine root).
# The blanket un-ignore below means no ancestor .gitignore rule can ever exclude an
# archived file. Rules further down still win, hence the dump exception.
!*
!*/

# Local-only database snapshots (pg_dump, custom format): sha256s are recorded in
# MANIFEST.sha256 and verified when present, but the dumps themselves are not committed.
db-*.dump
